                <pb facs="0407" n="327" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg327"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Squiers</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that President Palma’s message of congratulation by reason of the
                    national anniversary of the Independence of the United States is received with
                    much gratification by this Government.)</p>
            </div>
